# negativespace - sparse pentatonic stabs, mostly silence
bpm 122
swing 8
humanize kick 10
humanize hat 10
humanize oh 10
humanize clap 10
humanize snare 10
humanize perc 10
humanize bass 10
humanize stab 10
kick x...x...x...x...
hat x....x....x.....
perc x.......x.......
tune perc 780
stab a2! . . . . g2 . . . . d2 . . . . .
filter stab lp 1600 res 0.5
sidechain stab 0.5
